{"id":"modo","lemma":"modo","pos":"noun","rank":459,"glosses":["way, manner","mood"],"ipa":"/ˈmodo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"modos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/23/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-modo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Lo preguntaré de otro modo.","en":"Let me rephrase it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449814"},{"text":"De todos modos, quiero verlo.","en":"In any case, I want to see it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152205"},{"text":"Me sentía del mismo modo.","en":"I felt the same way.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/578470"},{"text":"Es inteligente, pero de todos modos no me gusta.","en":"He's intelligent, but I still don't like him.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/608617"},{"text":"En cierto modo lo comprendo.","en":"I sort of understand.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453338"}]}